WEBVTT

00:50.049 --> 00:51.134
ALL FIGURES,
INCIDENTS, LOCATIONS,

00:51.217 --> 00:52.469
ORGANIZATIONS,
AND OTHERS ARE FICTITIOUS.

00:52.552 --> 00:53.970
CHILD ACTORS AND ANIMALS
WERE FILMED SAFELY

00:54.054 --> 00:54.971
IN ACCORDANCE WITH GUIDELINES.

01:27.629 --> 01:29.005
What brings you here, Mr. Attorney?

01:30.548 --> 01:31.883
Why are you here?

01:35.011 --> 01:36.513
I don't know.

01:36.596 --> 01:40.725
I went wherever my feet took me
and ended up here.

01:43.978 --> 01:45.438
Why haven't you…

01:47.357 --> 01:48.942
burned the talisman yet?

01:51.945 --> 01:53.238
I'm not sure.

01:55.031 --> 01:56.282
Maybe I wanted to find

01:57.617 --> 02:00.745
even just a tiny excuse not to burn it.

02:04.207 --> 02:05.208
But…

02:07.502 --> 02:09.546
the more I listened to others…

02:12.173 --> 02:13.758
the more my disappointment grew.

02:19.013 --> 02:20.014
Now…

02:21.182 --> 02:23.017
I'm done looking for excuses.

02:26.604 --> 02:28.064
Despite what others say,

02:29.107 --> 02:30.191
I've decided

02:31.943 --> 02:33.528
to believe…

02:36.739 --> 02:38.324
what I know and remember of you.

02:47.083 --> 02:48.751
You were born

02:50.587 --> 02:51.921
on August 15, 1963.

02:53.840 --> 02:55.008
Your name is Shin Gi-jung.

02:59.512 --> 03:00.513
You are…

03:05.143 --> 03:06.644
my father.

03:20.617 --> 03:22.702
-Dad!
-Sa-rang.

03:25.121 --> 03:26.998
All right. Let's play catch, I-rang.

03:27.790 --> 03:29.042
Good?

03:37.425 --> 03:38.551
Dad!

04:23.304 --> 04:24.305
You are…

04:24.389 --> 04:25.390
Dad!

04:37.402 --> 04:38.403
…my son…

04:41.239 --> 04:42.573
I-rang.

04:45.868 --> 04:47.245
Dad…

04:50.290 --> 04:51.332
I-rang.

05:33.541 --> 05:35.043
Your hands used to be so tiny.

05:37.378 --> 05:38.755
They're so big now.

05:46.345 --> 05:47.346
Your mom…

05:50.475 --> 05:51.476
is well, right?

05:55.271 --> 05:56.272
She is.

06:00.234 --> 06:01.235
And healthy?

06:03.112 --> 06:05.239
Yes, she's very healthy.

06:07.241 --> 06:08.242
What about Sa-rang?

06:08.993 --> 06:09.994
Oh, right.

06:10.787 --> 06:13.873
The paralegal called you
his brother-in-law.

06:16.584 --> 06:18.169
He must be my son-in-law.

06:20.004 --> 06:21.005
That's right.

06:22.048 --> 06:25.593
He's a little silly and off the wall,

06:26.385 --> 06:29.764
-he's really--
-Nice, I know. He's a good man.

06:31.557 --> 06:33.142
I only got to talk to him a little,

06:34.727 --> 06:36.020
but I could tell right away.

06:49.492 --> 06:52.703
This is where Mom works.

06:53.287 --> 06:55.623
Your mom runs a butcher's?

06:57.250 --> 06:58.251
Yes.

06:58.876 --> 07:01.796
And right next to it
is the restaurant that Sa-rang runs.

07:02.797 --> 07:04.715
This is totally unexpected.

07:05.299 --> 07:08.678
It's quite famous in this neighborhood.

07:09.929 --> 07:11.097
I see.

07:14.225 --> 07:15.685
Let's go inside.

07:16.269 --> 07:17.270
Wait.

07:18.646 --> 07:21.232
You'd better go alone for now.

07:22.525 --> 07:24.777
They might be shocked if you possess me.

07:25.778 --> 07:27.363
I'll wait at my office.

07:28.823 --> 07:29.907
All right.

07:47.467 --> 07:49.760
When you aren't sure about yourself,

07:50.386 --> 07:53.723
take a deep breath and think to yourself
that you can do it.

07:53.806 --> 07:56.309
It will bring you real courage.

08:24.587 --> 08:26.172
Can you do this for me?

08:47.151 --> 08:48.277
Honey.

09:21.185 --> 09:22.770
Here you go. Enjoy.

09:22.853 --> 09:24.564
-Thank you.
-Thank you.

09:24.647 --> 09:25.648
Thank you.

09:32.446 --> 09:34.574
-You ordered the spicy pork, right?
-Yes.

09:35.616 --> 09:37.243
Here you go.

09:37.326 --> 09:40.454
Your spicy pork. And here's the stew.
Be careful, it's hot.

09:40.538 --> 09:43.040
-Let me know if you need anything.
-Dad!

09:43.833 --> 09:46.252
I want ice cream.

09:46.335 --> 09:47.753
-"Dad"?
-Buy me ice cream.

09:47.837 --> 09:49.171
Ice cream?

09:49.797 --> 09:54.635
You already had chips earlier.
Save ice cream for tomorrow, Da-bong.

09:54.719 --> 09:57.972
-You must be my granddaughter.
-Ice cream and chips are different.

09:58.514 --> 10:00.308
-Yes, I know.
-Da-bong…

10:00.391 --> 10:04.270
-I do, but your mom doesn't.
-What a lovely name.

10:04.353 --> 10:06.856
Hmph. I hate you, Mom!

10:06.939 --> 10:08.399
I hate you too!

10:08.482 --> 10:09.984
Da-bong.

10:12.194 --> 10:15.364
Watch how you speak to your dad.

10:17.533 --> 10:18.576
Sa-rang?

10:22.204 --> 10:23.205
My daughter…

10:25.750 --> 10:27.043
My sweetheart, Sa-rang.

10:36.469 --> 10:37.845
Welcome.

10:40.514 --> 10:43.684
Da-bong, we'll talk again later.

10:44.310 --> 10:46.687
-No.
-What do you mean, no?

10:48.397 --> 10:50.274
Were you being good or naughty?

10:50.358 --> 10:52.735
-Pork belly, sir? Got it.
-I was naughty.

11:03.079 --> 11:04.205
I-rang.

11:06.374 --> 11:08.376
You must have
a lot of questions to ask me.

11:09.835 --> 11:10.836
What?

11:10.920 --> 11:13.756
You said I deceived people.

11:17.134 --> 11:18.135
Also…

11:19.428 --> 11:22.390
you said that
I'd want to die again out of shame

11:23.182 --> 11:24.642
if you told me who I was.

11:26.477 --> 11:30.398
Can you tell me why you said such a thing?

11:32.483 --> 11:34.443
I honestly don't remember

11:35.403 --> 11:36.946
my last moment.

11:38.823 --> 11:41.033
Nor do I remember how I died.

11:42.159 --> 11:43.744
What I can recall is

11:44.286 --> 11:47.790
that I was on my way
to collect crucial evidence

11:48.624 --> 11:51.335
for Mr. Yoon's case that day.

11:56.674 --> 11:58.092
Three minutes left to arrive.

12:22.783 --> 12:23.951
I'm not sure

12:25.703 --> 12:26.912
what happened next.

12:28.539 --> 12:30.124
There was an accident.

12:40.759 --> 12:42.511
You were taken to the ER,

12:44.221 --> 12:45.890
but you died

12:47.475 --> 12:49.018
before we arrived.

12:52.188 --> 12:53.189
And…

12:57.234 --> 12:58.277
I…

13:01.447 --> 13:03.866
want to hear your side of the story,

13:05.576 --> 13:08.829
not what others say about you.

13:23.802 --> 13:25.596
What I know…

13:29.141 --> 13:30.267
Okay.

13:39.985 --> 13:44.532
The first time I met Mr. Yoon was
because of a school violence case.

13:45.407 --> 13:48.619
Public outrage was boiling over
with a lot of people saying

13:48.702 --> 13:51.288
that the teacher ruined a student
through excessive punishment.

13:51.372 --> 13:53.249
But when we first met,

13:55.167 --> 13:57.878
Mr. Yoon was quite firm.

13:58.963 --> 14:03.884
A teacher must teach their students
to be responsible for their mistakes.

14:05.135 --> 14:06.303
I see.

14:06.387 --> 14:07.388
INVESTIGATION REPORT

14:10.933 --> 14:11.934
INTERROGATION REPORT

14:16.647 --> 14:17.940
EXPULSION WAS ENFORCED

14:19.066 --> 14:20.526
CRIMINAL AND INVESTIGATION RECORDS

14:21.110 --> 14:23.028
Upon actual investigation,

14:23.112 --> 14:26.282
it turned out that the teacher's decision
about the bullies was fair.

14:32.329 --> 14:34.623
-No!
-Damn, it stinks so much.

14:34.707 --> 14:38.168
For the breach of Article 17,
the duty to maintain good conduct,

14:38.252 --> 14:39.378
I order your expulsion.

14:39.461 --> 14:41.297
-What? Expulsion?
-It's not…

14:41.380 --> 14:42.381
I said it's not my fault.

14:42.464 --> 14:44.258
There was nothing legally wrong, either.

14:44.341 --> 14:46.260
NO GROUNDS FOR SUSPICION

14:46.886 --> 14:49.597
So, I decided not to prosecute him

14:49.680 --> 14:52.641
and thought the case was over.

14:52.725 --> 14:54.852
MAY 12
YOON DAE-MYEONG

14:55.853 --> 14:57.229
"Yoon Dae-myeong"?

14:58.063 --> 15:00.149
But a few days later,

15:00.232 --> 15:04.612
a flood of lawsuits and complaints
against Mr. Yoon began to pour in.

15:05.362 --> 15:10.117
Complainants were parents, colleagues,
and even outside figures.

15:10.826 --> 15:13.037
The cases were all different too.

15:13.120 --> 15:16.874
Mr. Yoon openly humiliated my daughter.

15:17.583 --> 15:20.628
It mentally traumatized her.

15:20.711 --> 15:23.923
Rumors said he touched female students.

15:24.006 --> 15:27.176
He called them in for counseling
and sneakily touched them.

15:27.259 --> 15:29.929
There's a rumor that
he takes bribes from parents

15:30.012 --> 15:32.848
and treats school funds for personal use.

15:32.932 --> 15:35.893
It shows he lacks a moral compass.

15:39.772 --> 15:41.482
Since the complaints were filed,

15:41.565 --> 15:44.401
I had no choice
but to investigate as a prosecutor.

15:44.485 --> 15:45.861
My conclusion was

15:45.945 --> 15:48.489
that Mr. Yoon was moral

15:49.448 --> 15:51.241
and upright.

15:51.825 --> 15:52.910
The problem was that

15:53.494 --> 15:56.664
a person like him could be…

15:58.749 --> 16:00.960
an eyesore for some people.

16:02.753 --> 16:04.213
An eyesore?

16:07.341 --> 16:09.385
I thought this series of complaints

16:09.468 --> 16:15.015
wasn't simply out of
a misunderstanding or hostility,

16:16.350 --> 16:19.061
but an intentional act
to bring Mr. Yoon down.

16:20.521 --> 16:24.483
I was aware of the sheer tenacity
of those who cunningly exploit the law,

16:26.151 --> 16:28.320
so I carefully gave him a piece of advice.

16:29.154 --> 16:30.155
Mr. Yoon.

16:31.448 --> 16:32.449
Is there…

16:34.201 --> 16:37.663
anyone you're in conflict with?

16:41.041 --> 16:43.377
Some may not like me.

16:44.628 --> 16:45.879
But that doesn't mean

16:47.047 --> 16:50.134
I should stop myself
from doing what I must do.

16:53.512 --> 16:55.222
With all due respect,

16:56.473 --> 17:00.853
why don't you re-examine
your relations with those around you?

17:01.770 --> 17:05.315
If you're in conflict with anyone,

17:05.399 --> 17:09.653
you might want to work things out
with them smoothly.

17:13.407 --> 17:14.742
Afterward…

17:16.535 --> 17:18.620
It must've been three months or so.

17:19.496 --> 17:21.623
I got a call from Mr. Yoon.

17:28.630 --> 17:29.631
Hello?

17:30.132 --> 17:32.926
Prosecutor Shin, I figured it out.

17:34.344 --> 17:39.266
He probably visited those
who may have suffered because of him.

17:46.732 --> 17:50.569
His first destination was
the bully student's house.

18:09.713 --> 18:14.051
There, he unexpectedly saw
the student's father

18:14.635 --> 18:17.679
with a prosecutor he'd seen
at the Prosecutors' Office.

18:20.015 --> 18:21.975
A prosecutor?

18:22.059 --> 18:26.188
He'd only seen him a few times
as he frequented the Prosecutors' Office.

18:26.271 --> 18:28.607
He didn't know his name or department.

18:30.234 --> 18:32.569
He meant to ask me about him,

18:32.653 --> 18:34.530
but then, he thought it'd get complicated

18:35.489 --> 18:37.491
if everything turned out
to be a misunderstanding.

18:38.617 --> 18:43.205
So, he sought another way
to look into it carefully.

18:49.545 --> 18:50.754
Hello?

18:50.838 --> 18:54.216
Prosecutor Shin, I figured it out.

18:54.883 --> 18:56.510
What do you mean by that?

18:56.593 --> 18:58.887
I recorded their conversation.

18:59.847 --> 19:03.350
I hid the recorder just in case.

19:04.351 --> 19:06.770
You're the only one I can trust.

19:07.437 --> 19:08.438
Please,

19:09.314 --> 19:11.358
make sure to reveal the truth.

19:13.527 --> 19:14.903
Just a moment, Mr. Yoon.

19:22.369 --> 19:23.370
Yes.

19:28.750 --> 19:29.751
Got it.

19:30.586 --> 19:31.920
I'm on my way now.

19:32.754 --> 19:33.797
And…

19:36.216 --> 19:39.261
my memory ends

19:40.345 --> 19:42.139
when I went to collect the recorder.

19:46.560 --> 19:47.561
That day,

19:49.479 --> 19:50.772
Mr. Yoon

19:51.857 --> 19:53.692
was found to have committed suicide.

19:54.318 --> 19:55.319
What?

19:56.987 --> 19:58.197
That's absurd.

19:59.865 --> 20:02.117
The last time we spoke,

20:03.952 --> 20:07.915
he was full of hope
that he'd be cleared of false charges.

20:09.374 --> 20:10.375
But he killed himself?

20:20.093 --> 20:21.094
Did I…

20:22.512 --> 20:26.183
die on the same day as Mr. Yoon?

20:29.978 --> 20:30.979
Yes.

20:33.023 --> 20:36.610
And your body tested positive
for narcotics.

20:38.195 --> 20:41.365
Your cabinet was
filled with evidence of corruption.

20:41.949 --> 20:42.950
Narcotics

20:44.701 --> 20:46.536
and evidence of corruption?

20:47.955 --> 20:49.998
I don't get it.

20:50.082 --> 20:51.208
People thought

20:52.417 --> 20:56.672
you took bribes from someone
and used your position as a prosecutor

20:57.297 --> 20:59.591
to torment Mr. Yoon relentlessly,

21:00.509 --> 21:01.635
which caused

21:02.552 --> 21:04.763
Mr. Yoon to commit suicide.

21:04.846 --> 21:07.266
What are you talking about?
That's ridiculous!

21:13.105 --> 21:15.107
It's not true.

21:15.732 --> 21:18.819
I-rang, none of that makes sense.

21:18.902 --> 21:20.195
I'm sorry, Dad.

21:21.571 --> 21:23.156
I thought the same

21:24.199 --> 21:25.659
as everyone else.

21:27.369 --> 21:30.747
I wanted to believe otherwise,

21:32.541 --> 21:34.876
but I blamed and resented
a corrupt prosecutor

21:36.712 --> 21:38.338
whom the world pointed fingers at.

21:39.881 --> 21:42.592
That's why I was so harsh on you

21:42.676 --> 21:44.469
when you showed up.

21:46.763 --> 21:47.764
I see.

21:54.646 --> 21:55.814
But in the end,

21:57.232 --> 21:58.775
you decided to believe me.

22:01.028 --> 22:02.988
The one person who believes in me.

22:06.199 --> 22:07.200
Yes, that.

22:08.201 --> 22:09.995
That's all I need.

22:14.124 --> 22:15.542
What I remembered of you…

22:17.586 --> 22:19.046
was right.

22:26.720 --> 22:27.763
From now on,

22:28.513 --> 22:29.598
we'll set things right.

22:32.225 --> 22:33.435
I'll do it for you.

22:36.104 --> 22:37.355
Thank you.

23:08.720 --> 23:10.347
I have something to tell you, Father.

23:12.057 --> 23:13.100
Take a seat there.

23:25.028 --> 23:27.572
I met the shaman just now.

23:30.033 --> 23:31.409
Shin I-rang's father.

23:32.577 --> 23:36.456
Why do you bother with him?
Shin Gi-jung died 20 years ago.

23:39.876 --> 23:42.254
Let's say Shin I-rang
does see his father's spirit.

23:42.337 --> 23:43.922
But what does it have to do with you?

23:44.714 --> 23:46.508
Why do you care so much that you even

23:47.217 --> 23:48.844
locked up the shaman in this building?

23:49.386 --> 23:52.639
I didn't expect you'd discover all that.

23:53.140 --> 23:54.141
Good job.

23:54.933 --> 23:56.226
Father.

23:59.229 --> 24:02.149
Shin Gi-jung was my direct junior.

24:04.401 --> 24:07.737
He was a great prosecutor
of unmatched diligence

24:07.821 --> 24:10.657
and had profound insight in every case.

24:16.079 --> 24:17.080
Hello?

24:17.164 --> 24:18.331
Byung-il.

24:18.415 --> 24:19.708
My hunch was right.

24:21.668 --> 24:24.045
What's the occasion?
It's not like you to get so worked up.

24:24.129 --> 24:28.008
I told you some forces were
intentionally harassing Mr. Yoon.

24:30.051 --> 24:31.178
It was a senior prosecutor.

24:33.513 --> 24:34.723
What are you talking about?

24:34.806 --> 24:37.934
A prosecutor took bribes
from the bully student's father

24:38.018 --> 24:39.853
and targeted Mr. Yoon for investigation.

24:41.104 --> 24:42.981
What… Are you sure about this?

24:43.773 --> 24:45.734
Act rashly

24:45.817 --> 24:48.528
and you might get the blunt end
of being labeled as a whistleblower.

24:48.612 --> 24:50.947
So I'm going to double-check it.

24:51.781 --> 24:54.743
Mr. Yoon told me
where he hid the recorded evidence.

24:55.410 --> 24:57.662
I'm on my way to collect it.

24:58.246 --> 24:59.331
Gi-jung.

24:59.915 --> 25:01.416
Be careful.

25:01.499 --> 25:02.500
Of course, I will.

25:02.584 --> 25:05.545
Don't worry.
I'll talk to you again when I'm back.

25:06.546 --> 25:09.507
But I didn't hear from him after that.

25:11.301 --> 25:15.096
Later that night, I was informed
Gi-jung and Mr. Yoon were found dead.

25:16.514 --> 25:17.515
So what?

25:17.599 --> 25:18.725
Shin Gi-jung is

25:20.060 --> 25:22.687
the only person who knows
where the recorder is.

25:22.771 --> 25:24.940
Why are you so concerned
with this recorder?

25:29.653 --> 25:33.323
I'm the chief prosecutor
who harassed Yoon Dae-myeong

25:34.407 --> 25:35.992
at the bully student's father's request.

25:37.535 --> 25:38.536
What?

25:49.381 --> 25:50.382
Why, Father?

25:50.465 --> 25:51.758
I did it to survive.

25:55.470 --> 25:58.139
At the time, I was losing my footing

25:58.223 --> 26:00.976
after the chief prosecutor I served
was sidelined.

26:02.477 --> 26:05.772
That was when I got an offer.

26:05.855 --> 26:09.609
DAEHUN LAW FIRM

26:09.693 --> 26:12.487
I heard you're looking
for a law firm to join.

26:14.948 --> 26:18.201
If you quietly take care
of my daughter's case,

26:19.035 --> 26:21.830
I'll bring you on board
with preferential treatment.

26:25.083 --> 26:26.376
Well,

26:27.752 --> 26:30.088
I can do that much myself.

26:31.089 --> 26:32.465
I'm not sure

26:33.633 --> 26:36.928
if it's worth taking such a risk.

26:39.055 --> 26:41.141
Then what do you want in exchange?

26:44.436 --> 26:45.437
A future.

26:48.106 --> 26:49.649
A guaranteed future

26:50.942 --> 26:52.277
that can never be shaken.

26:56.448 --> 27:00.535
PERSONAL BACKGROUND INFORMATION
NAME: YOON DAE-MYEONG

27:09.085 --> 27:11.629
It was the first and last time
I ever abandoned my convictions

27:11.713 --> 27:12.964
as a man of the law.

27:14.215 --> 27:17.510
I hired people
to file complaints and lawsuits.

27:18.511 --> 27:21.181
Yoon Dae-myeong gave up on his life
too easily.

27:23.141 --> 27:24.142
And then,

27:25.852 --> 27:27.645
I became the owner of Taebaek.

27:30.231 --> 27:31.232
Did you

27:32.776 --> 27:34.444
kill Yoon Dae-myeong

27:35.445 --> 27:36.613
and Shin Gi-jung?

27:39.532 --> 27:40.533
No.

27:41.409 --> 27:43.119
I didn't kill anyone.

27:52.921 --> 27:57.759
CHARCOAL BRIQUETTE

28:14.109 --> 28:17.487
Like I said, he was so hopeless
that he took his own life.

28:31.251 --> 28:34.671
And Shin Gi-jung died
in an unfortunate accident.

28:43.513 --> 28:44.514
Yeah?

28:45.056 --> 28:46.307
It's all been taken care of.

29:42.530 --> 29:43.782
I had no idea

29:45.033 --> 29:47.202
Gi-jung was using drugs.

30:15.104 --> 30:20.235
Additionally, all of his other
corrupt acts were found in his cabinet.

30:22.070 --> 30:23.279
That's what happened.

30:25.406 --> 30:27.700
Shin Gi-jung committed the corruption,

30:29.410 --> 30:31.830
but I can't say I'm fully innocent.

30:38.753 --> 30:39.879
Are you disappointed in me?

30:43.341 --> 30:44.342
No.

30:46.177 --> 30:49.681
I finally feel a connection to you.

30:51.850 --> 30:52.851
You trusted me

30:54.102 --> 30:56.187
and told me everything honestly.

31:03.903 --> 31:06.030
If Shin Gi-jung's spirit is back,

31:06.114 --> 31:08.950
he'll try to find the recorder for sure.

31:09.951 --> 31:11.953
He'll try to suffocate me with it.

31:13.079 --> 31:14.956
If no one stops him,

31:15.039 --> 31:16.833
Taebaek will go down.

31:16.916 --> 31:17.959
No.

31:19.127 --> 31:21.504
Taebaek will never go down, Father.

31:23.256 --> 31:24.757
Don't worry.

31:24.841 --> 31:25.842
I'll stop him.

31:25.925 --> 31:28.177
There are people better suited
for this kind of work.

31:50.408 --> 31:51.868
Don't make any rash moves.

31:53.453 --> 31:55.788
Wait for the perfect moment.

32:09.844 --> 32:11.054
Yes, Father.

32:17.185 --> 32:19.896
Is there anyone else
who knows about the recorder

32:20.563 --> 32:22.315
other than Mr. Yoon?

32:22.899 --> 32:24.192
Yes.

32:24.275 --> 32:25.401
Who?

32:27.362 --> 32:29.572
Chief Prosecutor Yang Byung-il.
He was my senior.

32:34.786 --> 32:35.870
I know him.

32:36.829 --> 32:41.125
He's the chairman
of a big law firm named Taebaek.

32:42.210 --> 32:43.586
It can't be him.

32:43.670 --> 32:45.922
We were like brothers.

32:46.547 --> 32:47.715
The culprit

32:49.217 --> 32:53.471
tried to stop the evidence from going out
even by killing you and Mr. Yoon.

32:54.430 --> 32:57.976
You know where the recorder is, right?

33:03.398 --> 33:04.816
The Yoon Dae-myeong case?

33:06.943 --> 33:09.946
I checked the records Mr. Yoon collected

33:10.029 --> 33:12.365
and noticed a lot of issues
in the initial investigation.

33:12.448 --> 33:15.785
Na-hyun, it was closed
as suicide 20 years ago.

33:15.868 --> 33:17.120
It may not be just one.

33:17.745 --> 33:19.664
-What?
-The victim, I mean.

33:20.748 --> 33:22.834
If Mr. Yoon was murdered,

33:22.917 --> 33:27.088
the death of Shin Gi-jung, who died
on the same day, is suspicious as well.

33:27.714 --> 33:29.382
There may be a connection.

33:31.759 --> 33:33.803
So, how do you want me to help?

33:34.387 --> 33:37.265
I want to meet the first witness.

33:37.932 --> 33:41.310
There are parts
where the statement doesn't add up.

33:41.811 --> 33:45.940
The witness said
he discovered the scene at 10 p.m.

33:46.024 --> 33:49.986
But the record says
the report was made at 3 a.m.

33:50.570 --> 33:53.197
He also said
the police were already there,

33:53.281 --> 33:55.575
but there's no dispatch record
at the local police station.

33:56.159 --> 33:57.660
It happened a long time ago.

33:57.744 --> 33:59.662
The witness may not still be in Korea

33:59.746 --> 34:01.330
or may no longer be alive.

34:01.414 --> 34:03.166
Still, look into it for me.

34:05.501 --> 34:06.753
I won't give you personal details.

34:07.462 --> 34:10.381
I'll contact him and ask
if he's okay to meet you.

34:11.090 --> 34:12.383
Thanks.

34:25.688 --> 34:26.814
Looking for something?

34:29.025 --> 34:30.026
Mom.

34:31.486 --> 34:32.737
Where is

34:33.613 --> 34:37.700
the brown handbag Dad bought you
when you were newlyweds?

34:38.951 --> 34:40.411
Why do you need it all of a sudden?

34:42.121 --> 34:44.123
-The thing is--
-Did…

34:46.459 --> 34:48.920
your dad say he put something in it?

35:25.790 --> 35:26.791
But Mom…

35:27.708 --> 35:29.377
how did you know?

35:37.635 --> 35:39.220
A few days ago,

35:40.054 --> 35:44.642
I found a paper crane
in the lunch box I packed for you.

35:48.146 --> 35:51.023
The same paper crane your dad used to put

35:51.774 --> 35:53.401
in his lunch box.

36:08.291 --> 36:09.292
Then,

36:10.209 --> 36:11.669
why did you act like

36:12.670 --> 36:14.005
you didn't know?

36:18.926 --> 36:20.178
The truth is…

36:22.180 --> 36:25.099
when I heard you could see ghosts,

36:26.225 --> 36:28.811
I hoped your dad would come.

36:30.396 --> 36:33.357
As I saw you right wrongs for the ghosts,

36:33.983 --> 36:36.611
my wish grew bigger.

36:37.153 --> 36:38.154
But…

36:39.697 --> 36:42.533
I knew how painful and hard it'd be

36:42.617 --> 36:45.870
for you to meet your dad again,

36:47.288 --> 36:49.081
so I couldn't bring myself to tell you.

36:51.250 --> 36:52.251
Mom.

36:53.377 --> 36:54.378
It turned out

36:56.005 --> 36:57.757
Dad was framed.

37:05.473 --> 37:07.433
Where is he?

37:07.516 --> 37:08.643
At the office.

37:10.311 --> 37:11.896
When everything is over,

37:13.147 --> 37:16.651
he wants to meet the family
with his head held high.

37:19.695 --> 37:24.242
He's a ghost now,
but he's still so inflexible.

37:25.868 --> 37:29.914
Okay. Bring him home
after everything is taken care of.

37:30.581 --> 37:32.583
And tell him

37:32.667 --> 37:34.210
that I, Park Gyeong-hwa,

37:34.961 --> 37:38.965
believe what Shin Gi-jung says
even if the world comes to an end.

37:42.385 --> 37:43.427
Okay.

38:37.690 --> 38:38.733
This is Yang Do-kyung.

38:38.816 --> 38:40.109
Oh.

38:40.192 --> 38:42.486
I heard from the Chairman.

38:42.570 --> 38:44.488
I was waiting for your call

38:45.281 --> 38:46.949
to tell you something.

38:47.992 --> 38:48.993
I'm listening.

38:49.577 --> 38:54.040
One of my boys got a call
from a prosecutor just a while ago.

38:55.041 --> 38:59.837
He said an attorney wanted to inquire
about the Yoon case from 20 years ago.

38:59.920 --> 39:00.921
Who's that?

39:01.005 --> 39:04.258
I looked into this attorney he mentioned.

39:06.886 --> 39:07.928
Her name is Han Na-hyun.

39:08.888 --> 39:11.390
She's a colleague of Shin I-rang.

39:12.016 --> 39:13.642
If the Chairman hears this--

39:13.726 --> 39:15.186
Don't mind her.

39:15.978 --> 39:16.979
Why's that?

39:17.063 --> 39:18.689
Attorney Han is one of us.

39:19.357 --> 39:20.358
Leave her be.

39:49.762 --> 39:52.723
This is where you wanted to come with me?

39:53.474 --> 39:54.475
Yeah.

39:55.559 --> 39:56.727
I wanted to come.

39:58.646 --> 39:59.855
This place hasn't changed.

40:01.732 --> 40:05.152
I always dropped by
whenever I faced big cases.

40:07.780 --> 40:09.490
All dressed up like that?

40:13.035 --> 40:15.871
I've worn the suit for 22 years
and I can't take it off.

40:30.136 --> 40:32.721
I came here with you sometimes
when you were little, remember?

40:34.014 --> 40:35.015
I do.

40:37.435 --> 40:38.936
I should be peeling it for you.

40:40.187 --> 40:41.772
But I can't even hold it.

40:44.567 --> 40:47.570
I can do it on my own now.

40:51.782 --> 40:52.992
Dad.

41:04.044 --> 41:05.045
Dad!

41:05.671 --> 41:07.256
You have to give me a warning.

41:08.048 --> 41:10.509
You used to like it when I peeled it

41:10.593 --> 41:13.596
and dipped it in salt for you like this.

41:21.937 --> 41:22.938
It's good.

41:26.859 --> 41:29.236
Boiled eggs are good
at the bathhouse indeed.

41:29.778 --> 41:31.113
They are.

41:31.197 --> 41:32.490
Hard to swallow, right?

41:34.408 --> 41:37.411
SUJEONG BATHHOUSE

41:46.504 --> 41:47.505
Shall we go?

41:51.675 --> 41:54.178
PITTER-PATTER BUTCHER-STYLE BBQ

42:12.071 --> 42:13.072
Mr. Yang.

42:14.573 --> 42:15.824
What brings you here?

42:15.908 --> 42:17.785
Stop what you're doing now.

42:18.953 --> 42:19.954
Why?

42:20.037 --> 42:21.455
You don't have to return to Taebaek.

42:22.081 --> 42:24.333
You can work with Shin I-rang.

42:24.959 --> 42:27.211
But don't try to discover the truth
behind this case.

42:27.294 --> 42:29.797
-Why shouldn't I discover the truth?
-It's dangerous.

42:32.383 --> 42:34.343
You know what I'm up to

42:34.843 --> 42:36.387
and that it's dangerous.

42:37.596 --> 42:39.473
Then, you must know
who'll put me in danger.

42:42.017 --> 42:43.519
Who is it?

42:49.650 --> 42:51.318
I'm telling you
because I care about you

42:52.778 --> 42:54.280
and we were colleagues once.

42:56.782 --> 42:58.242
I warned you.

43:16.093 --> 43:17.136
Prosecutor Kim?

43:17.219 --> 43:18.304
Hi, Na-hyun.

43:18.387 --> 43:21.473
I went over the Yoon Dae-myeong case
after you left.

43:21.557 --> 43:24.727
The first witness was
a member of the Four Dragons Gang

43:24.810 --> 43:27.438
which was dismantled
in Chinatown 20 years ago.

43:28.022 --> 43:29.398
A Four Dragons member?

43:29.481 --> 43:31.358
What's more important is

43:32.401 --> 43:34.612
that the prosecutor
who dismantled the gang

43:36.447 --> 43:37.781
was Shin Gi-jung.

43:57.885 --> 43:59.678
OCTOBER 10, 2003
SEOMGANG ELECTRONICS

44:01.055 --> 44:04.391
SEOMGANG ELECTRONICS

44:15.861 --> 44:19.365
I'm the son of Prosecutor Shin Gi-jung
from the Incheon Prosecutors' Office.

45:23.512 --> 45:26.723
SHIN I-RANG LAW OFFICE
PITTER-PATTER BUTCHER-STYLE BBQ

45:28.809 --> 45:29.810
Attorney Shin?

45:40.737 --> 45:42.197
It's not him.

46:09.558 --> 46:10.559
Who are you?

46:13.770 --> 46:15.355
Why aren't you saying anything?

46:20.402 --> 46:22.613
I can't be sure

46:23.489 --> 46:25.908
if you're allies

46:26.867 --> 46:28.076
or enemies

46:29.703 --> 46:30.704
with my I-rang.

46:32.206 --> 46:33.582
Enemies?

46:34.166 --> 46:35.959
You don't know how much I like…

46:38.378 --> 46:39.713
I mean, help him.

46:43.342 --> 46:45.135
Oh, check the necklace.

46:45.844 --> 46:48.263
My number's engraved on it.

46:57.272 --> 46:59.024
SHIN I-RANG
010-0976-1425

47:03.320 --> 47:04.488
ATTORNEY SHIN I-RANG

47:05.906 --> 47:07.866
ATTORNEY HAN NA-HYUN
010-0976-1425

47:07.950 --> 47:09.117
See?

47:15.791 --> 47:17.543
So, who are you?

47:17.626 --> 47:21.964
Why do you call Attorney Shin "my I-rang"?

47:23.340 --> 47:24.591
Are you a friend of his?

47:24.675 --> 47:27.135
Or… a family member?

47:29.179 --> 47:31.348
-Yes.
-What?

47:32.099 --> 47:33.350
Nice to meet you.

47:34.434 --> 47:35.978
I know it may be confusing,

47:37.104 --> 47:39.731
but I'm I-rang's dad…

47:41.817 --> 47:43.235
Shin Gi-jung.

47:44.486 --> 47:46.530
Forgive me for being rude--

47:46.613 --> 47:48.282
No, that's okay.

47:48.365 --> 47:49.783
Um…

47:49.866 --> 47:50.867
Father.

47:51.827 --> 47:54.746
Excuse me for being disrespectful.

47:55.622 --> 47:56.832
I'm so sorry.

47:56.915 --> 47:58.750
No, please don't be.

47:58.834 --> 48:00.085
I'm rather glad

48:00.669 --> 48:03.714
to see how much you care about my son.

48:05.382 --> 48:06.633
It was nice.

48:07.843 --> 48:09.761
Let me officially introduce myself.

48:11.597 --> 48:14.725
I'm colleagues with Attorney Shin I-rang.

48:15.309 --> 48:16.893
I'm Attorney Han Na-hyun.

48:16.977 --> 48:18.270
Nice to meet you.

48:21.481 --> 48:25.110
So, why aren't you waking him up?

48:28.155 --> 48:30.866
If you don't know how, let me--

48:30.949 --> 48:32.159
No, that's not it.

48:33.327 --> 48:34.328
I just…

48:38.415 --> 48:43.128
This recorder has a conversation
between those who framed Mr. Yoon.

48:45.047 --> 48:49.926
If it holds any kind of truth
that may put I-rang in danger…

48:52.763 --> 48:54.598
I'd like for him to be unaware of it.

48:55.932 --> 48:57.809
I cannot put my son in danger

48:57.893 --> 49:00.395
trying to resolve my own resentment.

49:04.024 --> 49:06.276
Attorney Shin remembered you

49:07.569 --> 49:09.946
as a righteous hero.

49:11.573 --> 49:14.868
Although you passed away
under false accusations,

49:15.452 --> 49:17.454
he wanted to believe in you to the end.

49:19.539 --> 49:21.792
That led him to become an attorney.

49:24.086 --> 49:29.174
Your son is more diligent
and responsible than anyone.

49:31.176 --> 49:34.096
He's handled a lot of difficult cases

49:34.971 --> 49:36.348
on his own.

49:38.100 --> 49:41.019
I'm sure he will do the same this time.

49:42.813 --> 49:43.897
Attorney Han.

49:47.025 --> 49:49.778
Thank you for letting me realize…

49:53.699 --> 49:54.700
that I should…

49:57.536 --> 49:59.830
leave the decision to him.

50:04.668 --> 50:06.753
Could you wake him up?

50:07.587 --> 50:08.714
Sure.

50:31.153 --> 50:32.529
Attorney Han?

50:33.864 --> 50:34.906
Are you okay?

50:37.576 --> 50:38.577
Why are we…

50:40.704 --> 50:41.830
I met your father.

50:43.457 --> 50:44.458
And…

50:45.751 --> 50:47.544
I know what that recorder is.

50:49.588 --> 50:52.132
I'm sorry for keeping it from you.

50:52.215 --> 50:55.343
It's all right.
I've been through it, you know.

50:57.804 --> 50:59.973
You were right.

51:01.975 --> 51:03.351
I was

51:04.352 --> 51:06.354
greatly mistaken about my dad.

51:08.565 --> 51:09.941
It's such a relief.

51:15.197 --> 51:17.741
You should check the recording now.

51:18.325 --> 51:19.826
Listen to it with me.

51:19.910 --> 51:21.369
Let's go inside.

51:22.162 --> 51:23.455
Okay.

51:27.667 --> 51:28.668
Hello?

51:30.754 --> 51:33.006
Shin I-rang arrived
at the office just now.

51:33.089 --> 51:34.841
PITTER-PATTER BUTCHER-STYLE BBQ

51:34.925 --> 51:36.551
Get the recorder from him first.

51:36.635 --> 51:38.512
Sure, but…

51:39.095 --> 51:42.599
Attorney Han Na-hyun is with him.

51:43.975 --> 51:46.144
What do we do about her?

51:51.066 --> 51:52.234
Do-kyung.

52:07.415 --> 52:08.542
Who are you people?

52:15.507 --> 52:16.633
Wow.

52:16.716 --> 52:19.344
I love the vibe of this office.

52:21.721 --> 52:23.598
It's perfect for a funeral.

52:27.727 --> 52:29.896
Oh, that must be it.

52:30.438 --> 52:32.816
-Bring it over.
-Says who?

52:36.111 --> 52:37.237
I-rang.

52:39.948 --> 52:41.867
Trust me and grab that thing.

52:54.629 --> 52:55.630
Fine.

52:57.465 --> 52:59.634
Here, take it.

53:25.160 --> 53:27.579
You still haven't turned over a new leaf,
Lee Tae-geon?

53:28.830 --> 53:29.831
What?

53:30.415 --> 53:32.375
-Boss!
-Are you okay, sir?

53:32.459 --> 53:34.377
What are you waiting for? Get him!

54:04.366 --> 54:05.784
Go get her, boys.

54:19.965 --> 54:20.966
Head!

55:09.681 --> 55:10.849
Shin I-rang!

55:18.273 --> 55:20.400
I don't care if you're ghost or human.

55:23.403 --> 55:24.529
The recorder.

55:27.407 --> 55:28.533
Bring it here.

55:34.956 --> 55:36.291
Wait.

55:38.251 --> 55:39.252
I get it,

55:40.086 --> 55:41.087
so stop.

55:46.009 --> 55:48.470
No, I-rang. Don't do it.

55:49.888 --> 55:51.556
I can't let you go like this.

55:52.807 --> 55:53.808
I'm sorry.

56:30.136 --> 56:31.513
Drag him here.

56:41.689 --> 56:44.359
You'll never get to listen to this.

56:45.151 --> 56:46.152
Got it?

56:54.160 --> 56:55.286
Shin I-rang!

57:08.800 --> 57:10.510
I'll never lose it again.

57:52.635 --> 57:56.556
SPECIAL THANKS TO
CHOI WON-YOUNG AND JUNG JAE-SUNG

58:12.655 --> 58:16.576
SHIN I-RANG
010-0976-1425

58:23.541 --> 58:24.626
Welcome.

58:25.460 --> 58:26.544
It…

58:26.628 --> 58:28.296
It must've been a long way… Oof!

58:28.379 --> 58:29.839
-I'll go again.
-Okay, cut.

58:30.840 --> 58:31.841
Mister.

58:32.926 --> 58:35.637
I want to go there.

58:36.846 --> 58:38.014
Are you…

58:38.973 --> 58:40.099
Hello?

58:41.684 --> 58:42.685
Let's go again.

58:44.395 --> 58:46.981
You're going back in there?

58:47.065 --> 58:48.525
They thought I was a woman--

58:49.067 --> 58:51.027
They thought I was a gangster
and cornered me.

58:51.110 --> 58:52.278
Sorry!

58:52.362 --> 58:53.363
My bad.

58:54.030 --> 58:57.325
The shine of his cheap shoes shows

58:57.408 --> 58:58.785
his diligent nature.

58:59.327 --> 59:02.038
The leather surface appears
to be in good condition,

59:02.121 --> 59:03.957
which shows…

59:05.542 --> 59:06.543
I'm sorry.

59:07.085 --> 59:08.336
Tae-in, you do it.

59:08.419 --> 59:10.255
Do we have a large party?

59:10.338 --> 59:11.714
I-rang is strange.

59:13.049 --> 59:14.634
Oh, sorry. That's not the line.

59:21.933 --> 59:22.934
Ow, that hurts.

59:24.352 --> 59:25.562
It didn't break.

59:25.645 --> 59:29.566
Subtitle translation by: Eunjin Erica Kim
